{
  "run_id": "PMC12941970__broad__web_trend_o1_ground_b_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The untreated high-entropy alloy has its native surface structure and only a minimal pre-formed oxide layer.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A single-step controlled pre-oxidation in a low-oxygen atmosphere will generate a 1–5 μm thick nanocomposite oxide-rich tribolayer.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The engineered tribolayer will be adherent and consist of multiple metal oxides in a nanocomposite structure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tribolayer will withstand mechanical shear and resist spallation across a wide temperature range.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-formed tribolayer will persist while maintaining ductility and lubricity under variable thermal loads.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer will act as a lubricious boundary that reduces friction during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide-rich boundary will shear easily during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-formed oxide layer will be self-healing.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanocomposite oxide structure combines strength or hardness with ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Resistance to cracking and delamination of the oxide layer will minimize wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will remain effective from ambient temperature to approximately 800 °C.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compared with untreated alloy, the treatment will reduce both coefficient of friction and wear rate.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The improvements in both friction and wear may be at least approximately 20%.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated high-entropy alloy surfaces rely on in situ formation of oxide-containing tribofilms during sliding.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8448869::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "In situ tribofilm formation on untreated alloys is less consistent over a broad temperature range than a pre-formed layer.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will remain effective under mechanical loads typical of self-lubricating moving components.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective layer may break down under loads above the tested regime.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Large deviations in oxidation time, temperature, or oxygen partial pressure from optimized conditions may cause the treatment to lose effectiveness.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
  ],
